WEBVTT

01:14.980 --> 01:18.260
[Meet Yourself]

01:19.980 --> 01:24.260
[Episode 20]

01:31.816 --> 01:34.855
To be honest, I can't
make difficult dishes,

01:34.856 --> 01:37.576
but I can master some easy recipes.

01:38.856 --> 01:39.856
Granny.

01:40.176 --> 01:41.536
Let's eat out.

01:41.936 --> 01:43.855
I'll take you to Galsang Flower Restaurant,

01:43.856 --> 01:44.936
have braised chicken.

01:45.816 --> 01:47.575
The meal is ready now.

01:47.576 --> 01:49.136
Why do we eat out?

01:57.936 --> 01:58.895
It smells good.

01:58.896 --> 02:00.416
I can smell it in the yard.

02:02.016 --> 02:03.576
Didn't you go to look after the patient?

02:03.576 --> 02:04.816
Why are you back now?

02:06.136 --> 02:07.456
Auntie Feng didn't allow me to stay.

02:07.456 --> 02:08.695
So I had to come home.

02:08.696 --> 02:09.975
What did you cook for granny?

02:09.976 --> 02:10.976
Look here.

02:15.896 --> 02:18.856
Eating with you is like
to poison our granny.

02:20.216 --> 02:21.416
Leave if you don't eat.

02:21.856 --> 02:23.376
Enough talk.

02:26.776 --> 02:27.776
Listen,

02:27.976 --> 02:29.576
this is the recipe of my hometown.

02:29.976 --> 02:32.655
It looks common,
but the taste is good.

02:32.656 --> 02:33.592
Try it.

02:33.616 --> 02:35.576
I have confidence in red braised fish.

02:45.376 --> 02:46.536
How is it? Good?

02:49.376 --> 02:50.376
You put vinegar?

02:50.936 --> 02:52.016
For raw fish smell.

02:52.736 --> 02:53.736
How much did you put?

02:54.536 --> 02:55.896
Same as dark soy sauce.

02:57.576 --> 02:59.375
I think Yunan people like sour flavors.

02:59.376 --> 03:00.655
You have sour chicken feet.

03:00.656 --> 03:02.175
Sour papaya fish.

03:02.176 --> 03:03.032
Yes.

03:03.056 --> 03:04.336
I love sour food.

03:04.576 --> 03:05.576
I'll try it.

03:10.856 --> 03:12.535
It's good. Delicious.

03:12.536 --> 03:13.096
Right?

03:13.096 --> 03:14.096
Here.

03:14.976 --> 03:15.976
It's for you.

03:18.376 --> 03:19.015
Granny.

03:19.016 --> 03:19.935
Isn't it too much?

03:19.936 --> 03:21.496
Well. Eat more.

03:25.416 --> 03:26.015
Eat.

03:26.016 --> 03:26.735
Great.

03:26.736 --> 03:27.736
I'll eat.

03:34.216 --> 03:35.216
Yummy.

03:37.336 --> 03:38.135
I should have

03:38.136 --> 03:39.536
had the food delivery of braised chicken

03:39.536 --> 03:40.696
from Galsang Restaurant.

03:41.416 --> 03:42.695
It was not that bad.

03:42.696 --> 03:44.535
Though the slick of meat was thick,

03:44.536 --> 03:46.215
it tasted fresh with starch coating.

03:46.216 --> 03:48.135
Put less dark sauce on vegetables.

03:48.136 --> 03:49.616
Soy and oyster sauces are enough.

03:54.696 --> 03:55.615
Is it sour?

03:55.616 --> 03:56.616
I'll try one.

04:04.856 --> 04:05.815
It's too sour.

04:05.816 --> 04:06.895
Enough. Don't eat them.

04:06.896 --> 04:07.696
It is sour.

04:07.696 --> 04:08.696
One more try.

04:14.536 --> 04:16.336
We should stop here.

04:16.976 --> 04:18.176
The grapes won't be sweeter

04:18.176 --> 04:20.456
if we keep eating them.

04:22.216 --> 04:24.455
The shop owner said they are sweet.

04:24.456 --> 04:26.096
And I ate some, they were good.

04:28.216 --> 04:29.216
The same bunch?

04:29.856 --> 04:30.375
No.

04:30.376 --> 04:31.295
So you know why.

04:31.296 --> 04:32.135
Not the same brunch,

04:32.136 --> 04:33.976
and they may not be from the same root.

04:35.016 --> 04:36.456
So we just throw them away?

04:37.536 --> 04:39.175
We can make jam or wine.

04:39.176 --> 04:40.456
All roads lead to Rome.

04:44.856 --> 04:46.216
Do you like plums?

04:47.256 --> 04:48.256
I like it.

04:49.176 --> 04:50.176
What about?

04:50.416 --> 04:51.976
We hold an event with our friends.

04:52.856 --> 04:53.856
Event?

04:54.256 --> 04:55.376
Pick fruits at an orchard.

04:55.656 --> 04:56.816
Eat while picking.

04:57.256 --> 04:59.096
What about the fee for each person?

04:59.656 --> 05:00.615
Don't worry.

05:00.616 --> 05:02.376
It's on me, and so is the lunch.

05:03.256 --> 05:04.015
Sounds good.

05:04.016 --> 05:05.335
Boss's treat.

05:05.336 --> 05:06.336
When is it?

05:07.456 --> 05:08.895
There's no time like the present.

05:08.896 --> 05:10.256
What about tomorrow?

05:10.536 --> 05:11.535
Tomorrow?

05:11.536 --> 05:12.575
Unavailable?

05:12.576 --> 05:13.335
I am not.

05:13.336 --> 05:14.455
The deal, then.

05:14.456 --> 05:16.496
But Nana will work at the shop tomorrow.

05:16.976 --> 05:18.256
We'll have a day off.

05:20.096 --> 05:21.416
Boss. You're generous.

05:22.536 --> 05:23.095
Nice.

05:23.096 --> 05:24.096
Yeah.

05:29.056 --> 05:30.056
It's too hot.

05:32.456 --> 05:33.456
Sorry. My fault.

05:34.096 --> 05:35.096
Oh, my god.

05:38.256 --> 05:39.215
Are you ready?

05:39.216 --> 05:42.255
We are ready.

05:42.256 --> 05:43.415
Come again?

05:43.416 --> 05:44.936
Are you ready?

05:44.936 --> 05:47.536
We are ready.

05:47.536 --> 05:49.336
Here we go.

05:52.656 --> 05:53.375
Sing.

05:53.376 --> 05:55.376
Sun. Sun.

05:55.376 --> 06:01.456
Bring us the light of seven colors.

06:02.056 --> 06:06.376
Shine upon us, making
our spiritual flowers

06:06.376 --> 06:10.376
lovely and beautiful.

06:10.776 --> 06:15.136
Today, we grow
up in this sunshine.

06:15.136 --> 06:19.216
Tomorrow we will build a colorful world.

06:19.216 --> 06:21.655
Come with me.

06:21.656 --> 06:23.815
Come with me.

06:23.816 --> 06:26.015
Come with me.

06:26.016 --> 06:28.255
Come with me.

06:28.256 --> 06:30.336
Seven-color light. Seven-color light.

06:30.336 --> 06:32.616
The light of the sun.

06:32.616 --> 06:34.656
We step into the future

06:34.656 --> 06:38.616
with the dream of seven colors.

06:38.616 --> 06:41.176
One more time. Go.

06:41.176 --> 06:43.456
[It's all for the kids]

06:52.536 --> 06:53.696
I left my thermal mug.

06:57.376 --> 07:01.776
We step into the future with...

07:02.376 --> 07:06.175
The full moon is in the sky.

07:06.176 --> 07:09.775
The shadow accompanies me.

07:09.776 --> 07:15.016
Two people are with each other.

07:17.176 --> 07:20.656
The wind blows gently.

07:20.896 --> 07:24.376
A line is in the sky.

07:24.616 --> 07:29.896
The plane leaves the line.

07:33.616 --> 07:38.976
The flower blossoms at the end of the rainbow.

07:39.296 --> 07:41.496
Who left there...

07:42.176 --> 07:42.855
Enjoy.

07:42.856 --> 07:43.335
Thank you.

07:43.336 --> 07:44.336
Thanks.

08:09.936 --> 08:10.936
Nana.

08:11.856 --> 08:13.336
Here is a notification.

08:13.936 --> 08:16.256
Tomorrow is closed for a party event.

08:17.696 --> 08:18.815
An event for what?

08:18.816 --> 08:21.016
Our people will go to pick in the orchard.

08:21.016 --> 08:21.896
We can eat while picking.

08:21.896 --> 08:22.975
It's on Yao.

08:22.976 --> 08:24.335
Really?

08:24.336 --> 08:25.816
That's great.

08:26.576 --> 08:28.816
President Xie deserves to be my idol.

08:29.376 --> 08:30.376
But,

08:31.016 --> 08:34.095
remember to wear some old clothes tomorrow,

08:34.096 --> 08:35.735
with long sleeves.

08:35.736 --> 08:38.336
The orchard is full
of mud and branches.

08:38.736 --> 08:40.135
Remember sun protection.

08:40.136 --> 08:41.135
Get them informed.

08:41.136 --> 08:41.735
Got it.

08:41.736 --> 08:43.135
I'll create a chat room to tell our guys.

08:43.136 --> 08:44.136
Ok.

08:52.096 --> 08:53.096
Xiaochun.

08:53.776 --> 08:54.816
Hu.

08:55.776 --> 08:56.776
Nana.

08:57.456 --> 08:59.215
Triple-shot americano.

08:59.216 --> 08:59.895
Sure.

08:59.896 --> 09:00.896
Thank you.

09:03.056 --> 09:05.496
And, we're going to
the orchard tomorrow.

09:05.976 --> 09:07.655
You're going, too?

09:07.656 --> 09:08.976
I'm going with everyone.

09:09.536 --> 09:10.536
Everyone?

09:10.656 --> 09:12.055
Including me?

09:12.056 --> 09:13.376
I, I am not in.

09:13.376 --> 09:14.175
Have fun.

09:14.176 --> 09:15.176
Not going?

09:16.016 --> 09:16.735
Why don't you join us?

09:16.736 --> 09:17.736
You have lectures?

09:18.936 --> 09:21.255
You remind me of something.

09:21.256 --> 09:23.056
I found a miracle today.

09:24.096 --> 09:25.295
What is it?

09:25.296 --> 09:27.775
You told me, the
accordion teacher

09:27.776 --> 09:29.695
of kindergarten has gone, right?

09:29.696 --> 09:31.095
But you know what?

09:31.096 --> 09:32.255
During lecture break,

09:32.256 --> 09:34.375
a teacher could play it suddenly.

09:34.376 --> 09:35.776
Isn't it a miracle?

09:36.776 --> 09:37.776
No.

09:38.096 --> 09:39.415
It has nothing to do with me.

09:39.416 --> 09:40.175
It's Yao's idea.

09:40.176 --> 09:41.176
You can ask him.

09:44.776 --> 09:46.016
I know it's not you.

09:50.616 --> 09:52.096
What did he do it for?

09:52.936 --> 09:54.295
Why didn't he tell me directly?

09:54.296 --> 09:55.536
He shouldn't hide it from me.

09:55.976 --> 09:56.976
Why?

09:57.416 --> 09:58.416
He felt pity for me?

09:59.696 --> 10:01.136
Others won't make fun of me?

10:03.496 --> 10:04.496
I don't need it.

10:06.736 --> 10:07.736
What?

10:09.256 --> 10:11.136
What did you mean?

10:11.896 --> 10:13.696
He felt pity for you?

10:13.936 --> 10:15.336
It was you who locked yourself at home.

10:15.336 --> 10:16.376
Your room was smoking.

10:16.376 --> 10:17.615
You didn't write any songs.

10:17.616 --> 10:19.055
Your mental condition is getting worse.

10:19.056 --> 10:20.535
We are worried about you.

10:20.536 --> 10:23.056
So Yao had this idea to help you overcome,

10:23.056 --> 10:24.456
and get some fresh air.

10:25.736 --> 10:28.375
But I have artistic pursuit.

10:28.376 --> 10:30.535
I taught kids to sing.

10:30.536 --> 10:32.336
I, I... I do it for a
change of pace,

10:32.336 --> 10:33.856
and I can go to... Where to go in the end?

10:33.856 --> 10:35.775
What's wrong with the kids?

10:35.776 --> 10:37.655
They are pure.

10:37.656 --> 10:39.096
They don't care about your age,

10:39.096 --> 10:40.535
payment and social status.

10:40.536 --> 10:43.056
They only feel that
Mr. Hu, you are excellent.

10:43.056 --> 10:45.656
Can you drop your pride
and stop being utilitarian?

10:46.056 --> 10:46.696
As adults,

10:46.696 --> 10:48.856
actually, we can learn a lot from kids.

10:48.856 --> 10:50.255
It's enough of you.

10:50.256 --> 10:51.256
Get out of the way.

12:06.776 --> 12:08.876
[Youfeng Yard Chat Room]

12:08.876 --> 12:12.156
[Tomorrow Morning at eight o'clock.
Don't forget old clothes and sun protection.]

12:22.876 --> 12:26.156
[No problem.
Got it.]

12:33.876 --> 12:37.156
[Got it.]

12:43.656 --> 12:44.656
Yao.

12:47.296 --> 12:48.296
Nana.

12:48.896 --> 12:50.335
What's in your hand?

12:50.336 --> 12:51.135
A tent.

12:51.136 --> 12:53.016
When we get tired, we
play card games there.

12:54.816 --> 12:55.816
Hu.

12:56.016 --> 12:57.416
Why do you have a guitar?

12:57.656 --> 12:59.296
If I have a sudden whim,

12:59.576 --> 13:01.416
I'll sing a song.

13:02.976 --> 13:03.976
Yao.

13:04.096 --> 13:05.496
Don't you stop him?

13:06.096 --> 13:07.175
It's good.

13:07.176 --> 13:08.616
We can refresh by it.

13:09.256 --> 13:10.856
How could you accept it?

13:11.216 --> 13:12.376
Don't come to me for help.

13:12.376 --> 13:13.816
I don't take the side of bad things.

13:16.056 --> 13:17.176
See you later.

13:20.096 --> 13:21.096
What did she say?

13:21.376 --> 13:22.576
Take the side of bad things?

13:23.016 --> 13:23.855
What did she mean?

13:23.856 --> 13:24.575
What did she mean?

13:24.576 --> 13:25.415
What was it?

13:25.416 --> 13:26.416
What was it?

13:28.656 --> 13:30.375
The orchard is ahead of us.

13:30.376 --> 13:32.295
Enjoy the plum harvest today.

13:32.296 --> 13:34.536
And enjoy daily country life.

13:39.576 --> 13:40.616
What's wrong with him?

13:41.296 --> 13:42.656
Something wrong with his brain.

13:43.456 --> 13:44.656
I can hear you.

13:49.696 --> 13:51.176
His ears are good.

14:02.896 --> 14:04.416
Come on.

14:04.936 --> 14:05.335
Mr. Hu.

14:05.336 --> 14:07.255
Why did you take your guitar to the field?

14:07.256 --> 14:08.256
I'm crazy.

14:10.096 --> 14:12.056
Nana brought us her tent.

14:13.016 --> 14:15.376
We'll find a space to
put up the tent later.

14:15.376 --> 14:16.615
You can put your stuff in

14:16.616 --> 14:18.096
when you take a break there.

14:29.336 --> 14:31.096
I'm not lying to you.

14:31.536 --> 14:32.735
Pick up in the orchard.

14:32.736 --> 14:34.255
You can eat while picking.

14:34.256 --> 14:35.296
Lunch is on me.

14:36.656 --> 14:37.656
It's really true.

14:38.016 --> 14:39.456
Your game of words.

14:40.296 --> 14:41.255
Just for fun.

14:41.256 --> 14:42.256
Rest if you're tired.

14:44.496 --> 14:45.816
Is it for us?

14:46.216 --> 14:46.775
- Yes.
- Yes.

14:46.776 --> 14:47.695
I'll choose one.

14:47.696 --> 14:48.336
- Yes.
- Yes.

14:48.336 --> 14:49.496
My head may be too big.

14:49.856 --> 14:51.375
Thank you so much.

14:51.376 --> 14:52.895
It's so hot today.

14:52.896 --> 14:55.455
Yao told you what
happened to my family.

14:55.456 --> 14:56.655
So you came to help us.

14:56.656 --> 14:58.535
You have yet to try orchard works.

14:58.536 --> 14:59.895
It's exhausting

14:59.896 --> 15:01.855
You don't have to pick too many of them.

15:01.856 --> 15:02.832
We can do it.

15:02.856 --> 15:04.656
Damai and I want to have a try.

15:04.936 --> 15:05.895
Thanks. Thank you.

15:05.896 --> 15:06.616
Well, guys.

15:06.616 --> 15:07.455
Auntie Feng.

15:07.456 --> 15:08.415
I'm going to pick with you.

15:08.416 --> 15:10.815
Yao will take care of those who he took here.

15:10.816 --> 15:11.136
Basket.

15:11.136 --> 15:12.015
Don't mind. Auntie.

15:12.016 --> 15:13.095
I'll tell them how to do it.

15:13.096 --> 15:13.896
Okay. Thank you so much.

15:13.896 --> 15:14.496
It's not a problem.

15:14.496 --> 15:15.176
Thank you.

15:15.176 --> 15:16.176
Let's go, auntie.

15:19.616 --> 15:21.296
You know me, I am so considerate

15:21.296 --> 15:23.135
that I prepared ice arm sleeves.

15:23.136 --> 15:24.055
Xu Hongdou.

15:24.056 --> 15:25.175
Pink is for you.

15:25.176 --> 15:26.456
You can use it.

15:27.176 --> 15:28.896
I thought what was in your bag was a snack.

15:29.696 --> 15:30.976
You can get whatever you like here.

15:30.976 --> 15:32.256
It's no need for a snack.

15:33.416 --> 15:34.496
Except for sleeves,

15:35.696 --> 15:38.695
I also prepared sun
protective clothing

15:38.696 --> 15:40.175
for you, kind and gorgeous ladies,

15:40.176 --> 15:41.896
in case of sun damage.

15:42.456 --> 15:43.456
Which one?

15:44.616 --> 15:45.856
It's nice of you.

15:46.776 --> 15:48.936
Here, the last one
The prettiest one.

15:49.336 --> 15:50.615
Hongdou, let's do it together?

15:50.616 --> 15:51.776
Don't be shy. Take it.

15:51.776 --> 15:52.975
Don't you work today?

15:52.976 --> 15:55.336
I'm working now, to
solve villagers' problems.

15:57.696 --> 16:00.455
Well, I will put up the tent first.

16:00.456 --> 16:01.352
Hu.

16:01.376 --> 16:03.376
Do you need me to put your guitar in the tent?

16:11.296 --> 16:12.416
Hu. Let's go.

16:14.096 --> 16:15.096
Hu.Here.

16:15.376 --> 16:16.816
Try it. It's sweet.

16:25.296 --> 16:26.416
I'm curious.

16:27.496 --> 16:28.496
This thing,

16:28.656 --> 16:29.695
it tastes sour.

16:29.696 --> 16:31.536
But so why did they plant it?

16:31.976 --> 16:32.976
You have no idea.

16:33.376 --> 16:35.895
This kind of plum is
not eatable directly.

16:35.896 --> 16:37.655
It's planted to make alcohol,

16:37.656 --> 16:39.376
fruit preserves, or some dry fruits.

16:39.736 --> 16:40.536
We can't eat it directly.

16:40.536 --> 16:41.616
But you asked me to try.

16:42.616 --> 16:43.975
Cause I've tasted how sour it is.

16:43.976 --> 16:45.376
I can't be the only victim of it.

16:47.336 --> 16:49.576
Ma. Hu.

16:50.176 --> 16:51.216
Hurry up.

16:51.216 --> 16:52.415
You should pick quickly

16:52.416 --> 16:53.975
You were just keeping talking.

16:53.976 --> 16:54.655
What?

16:54.656 --> 16:55.775
Who needs to be quicker?

16:55.776 --> 16:56.375
Have you heard

16:56.376 --> 16:58.376
a story called the Hare and the Tortoise?

16:59.136 --> 17:02.015
Endurance makes the man.

17:02.016 --> 17:03.496
You will see it in the end.

17:05.056 --> 17:06.655
I will see.

17:06.656 --> 17:08.856
Do you think young ladies with healthy lifestyles

17:08.856 --> 17:10.456
can't fight against a middle-aged man

17:10.456 --> 17:13.815
who drinks every day
and doesn't take exercise?

17:13.816 --> 17:15.856
What do you call me?

17:16.216 --> 17:18.296
Don't you know I am a teenager?

17:18.776 --> 17:20.895
Well, I didn't see the teen strengths in you.

17:20.896 --> 17:22.776
If the wind comes,
you will be blown away.

17:23.816 --> 17:24.816
Huang.

17:25.136 --> 17:27.016
You should bring people together.

17:27.616 --> 17:28.575
First of all,

17:28.576 --> 17:30.975
I should make ladies stay together.

17:30.976 --> 17:32.176
Say something back with facts

17:32.176 --> 17:34.775
to accusations that are not true or logical.

17:34.776 --> 17:35.615
Not true, nor logical?

17:35.616 --> 17:37.096
Untrue accusations?

17:37.496 --> 17:38.535
Ma. Do me justice.

17:38.536 --> 17:39.655
Accusations?

17:39.656 --> 17:40.976
What did I accuse of?

17:41.856 --> 17:43.016
Huang is right.

17:43.336 --> 17:44.336
Hu Youyu.

17:44.656 --> 17:46.816
You are a black sheep.

17:48.776 --> 17:50.975
Yu means a free fish.

17:50.976 --> 17:52.696
Ma means a black sheep.

17:53.216 --> 17:54.575
Homophone joke.

17:54.576 --> 17:55.576
I know it.

17:56.136 --> 17:57.416
Here's water.

17:57.976 --> 17:59.215
You need water.

17:59.216 --> 18:00.216
Thank you.

18:03.296 --> 18:04.375
Easy. Take your time.

18:04.376 --> 18:05.376
It's fine to rest.

18:06.616 --> 18:07.896
This plum field of square kilos

18:07.896 --> 18:09.335
is planted all by Uncle Chang?

18:09.336 --> 18:10.152
Yes.

18:10.176 --> 18:11.375
Auntie has hypertension.

18:11.376 --> 18:13.695
Her heart is not good,
so she can't work here.

18:13.696 --> 18:16.735
On his own, he watered and fertilized the field,

18:16.736 --> 18:17.816
and sprayed pesticide.

18:18.816 --> 18:21.055
He also planted
scallions and potatoes.

18:21.056 --> 18:23.056
In all, it's about 4.67 square kilometers.

18:23.336 --> 18:24.575
After working in the field,

18:24.576 --> 18:26.895
he'd cut reeds to make brooms,

18:26.896 --> 18:28.255
or used the husks for baskets.

18:28.256 --> 18:29.615
He's never rested yet.

18:29.616 --> 18:31.216
That's why he is sick now.

18:31.976 --> 18:33.056
Didn't he hire anyone?

18:33.816 --> 18:35.255
It costs to hire people.

18:35.256 --> 18:36.495
For example, to pick plums,

18:36.496 --> 18:37.895
labor payment is high.

18:37.896 --> 18:40.095
At least 80 yuan per person.

18:40.096 --> 18:41.335
But productivity differs.

18:41.336 --> 18:42.575
The meal is included.

18:42.576 --> 18:44.655
So villagers know what is happening,

18:44.656 --> 18:46.615
they would come to help when available.

18:46.616 --> 18:47.776
It's interesting, actually,

18:47.776 --> 18:50.216
to experience the happiness of harvest.

18:52.016 --> 18:53.456
But it takes work.

18:54.096 --> 18:55.096
In short,

18:55.496 --> 18:57.255
let's try our best.

18:57.256 --> 18:57.855
Try our best.

18:57.856 --> 18:58.296
Try our best.

18:58.296 --> 18:58.816
Thank you.

18:58.816 --> 19:00.056
Try our best.

19:12.776 --> 19:16.056
♫ Stars in the sky ♫

19:16.776 --> 19:18.056
♫ I pick some mushrooms ♫

19:18.776 --> 19:21.035
♫ Mushrooms can fill the basket ♫

19:21.036 --> 19:24.056
♫ I take out a pen ♫

19:24.776 --> 19:27.056
♫ The pen leaks ink ♫

19:27.776 --> 19:30.056
♫ What can I do ♫

19:30.776 --> 19:34.056
♫ I have piles of mung beans ♫

19:37.776 --> 19:41.056
♫ Mung beans are delicious ♫

19:41.776 --> 19:43.776
♫ Gingers are tender ♫

19:43.776 --> 19:45.016
♫ Tender gingers taste pungent ♫

19:45.016 --> 19:47.336
Feng. Here's the dish

19:49.816 --> 19:51.735
They must be hungry.

19:51.736 --> 19:52.776
Are we safe?

19:53.736 --> 19:54.136
Time to eat.

19:54.136 --> 19:55.136
Easy.

19:56.776 --> 19:57.816
Why do you come here?

19:59.456 --> 20:00.256
Baoping doesn't know

20:00.256 --> 20:01.935
how to drive an electronic tricycle.

20:01.936 --> 20:03.255
So I have to come.

20:03.256 --> 20:05.535
Gui cooked all dishes.

20:05.536 --> 20:06.816
I only helped her.

20:07.136 --> 20:08.656
I can't cook well.

20:09.656 --> 20:11.176
I can only cook these easy dishes.

20:11.176 --> 20:11.656
Not that good.

20:11.656 --> 20:13.376
But it's delicious.

20:15.536 --> 20:17.215
Uncharacteristically nice of you.

20:17.216 --> 20:19.296
Did I hear the compliment for me?

20:19.936 --> 20:21.816
You're being too humble,

20:22.256 --> 20:23.856
so I have to say something good to you.

20:24.416 --> 20:26.455
Enough of you.

20:26.456 --> 20:27.336
Same as old times.

20:27.336 --> 20:28.776
For half of our lives.

20:29.256 --> 20:32.015
Gui's mouth is like a canyon shooting every day.

20:32.016 --> 20:34.855
It's only distinguished when Feng comes.

20:34.856 --> 20:36.816
I care about her heart.

20:48.016 --> 20:50.136
Why do I feel it's so delicious?

20:50.456 --> 20:51.856
It's great.

20:53.016 --> 20:54.575
More rice? Anyone?

20:54.576 --> 20:55.576
Damai. Here.

20:57.736 --> 20:58.736
Boys and girls.

20:59.976 --> 21:01.055
Here're spare ribs.

21:01.056 --> 21:01.696
We've had too much.

21:01.696 --> 21:02.135
It is.

21:02.136 --> 21:02.816
You need to rest.

21:02.816 --> 21:03.335
Yes.

21:03.336 --> 21:04.296
We will add it by ourselves.

21:04.296 --> 21:05.015
You should eat.

21:05.016 --> 21:06.255
You should eat more.

21:06.256 --> 21:06.935
Aunties.

21:06.936 --> 21:08.415
Where are my mom and Aunt Gui?

21:08.416 --> 21:10.056
They are picking plums there.

21:10.696 --> 21:11.936
Make yourself at home.

21:12.696 --> 21:13.335
Thank you.

21:13.336 --> 21:13.936
Thank you.

21:13.936 --> 21:15.336
Nothing. Just eat it.

21:18.816 --> 21:19.856
I've been working.

21:21.096 --> 21:22.256
I can't move at all now.

21:23.536 --> 21:24.856
The old couple,

21:25.136 --> 21:26.656
they are elderly now,

21:27.376 --> 21:29.136
how can they be so energetic?

21:30.416 --> 21:33.016
If you have a target, there's motivation.

21:33.976 --> 21:35.215
You have motivation,

21:35.216 --> 21:37.615
so you can have the energy to work.

21:37.616 --> 21:39.096
Though your life is tough,

21:39.536 --> 21:41.056
you can seek joy from it

21:41.736 --> 21:42.736
Frankly,

21:42.976 --> 21:43.496
it is all for

21:43.496 --> 21:46.255
their son, Xie Qiang to live an easy life.

21:46.256 --> 21:48.415
That's why they work so hard.

21:48.416 --> 21:48.935
Right?

21:48.936 --> 21:50.615
They should release the burden.

21:50.616 --> 21:52.415
The children have their luck.

21:52.416 --> 21:53.975
Only if they can think it through.

21:53.976 --> 21:55.856
This is how their generation lives.

21:56.176 --> 21:57.176
Yes.

21:57.416 --> 21:59.575
A grassroots movement is established for it.

21:59.576 --> 22:01.615
It helps them and makes them live better.

22:01.616 --> 22:03.056
We'll help many people as we can.

22:04.376 --> 22:05.376
Xinxin. Take it.

22:06.176 --> 22:07.176
It's enough.

22:08.736 --> 22:10.135
The ribs are amazing.

22:10.136 --> 22:11.735
Really? Here's more.

22:11.736 --> 22:12.616
I have one more to eat.

22:12.616 --> 22:13.696
I'll eat this one later.

22:26.096 --> 22:27.456
Why do you sit here?

22:29.936 --> 22:31.376
The wind feels good.

22:33.336 --> 22:34.215
You must be tired.

22:34.216 --> 22:35.216
It's fine.

22:36.376 --> 22:39.056
So... What are you thinking?

22:40.736 --> 22:42.855
I'm thinking about Auntie Feng.

22:42.856 --> 22:43.856
Auntie Feng?

22:45.336 --> 22:46.376
Her life is truly tough.

22:46.856 --> 22:48.296
No one said it's not true.

22:49.176 --> 22:52.296
Everyone lives under pressure now.

22:52.736 --> 22:53.856
It's different.

22:54.456 --> 22:56.376
When you still have another choice,

22:56.376 --> 22:57.816
so it's manageable.

22:58.496 --> 22:59.856
We can say it's hard.

23:01.536 --> 23:03.096
But the words mean the same.

23:03.496 --> 23:05.015
No, they are not.

23:05.016 --> 23:05.935
Like us.

23:05.936 --> 23:07.575
We are common people.

23:07.576 --> 23:09.056
Our life is hard.

23:09.456 --> 23:11.256
We still can find a bridge to cross the river

23:11.256 --> 23:12.256
Right?

23:12.336 --> 23:14.176
Some people eat hot pot and sing

23:14.736 --> 23:17.615
to cross the river on a ship.

23:17.616 --> 23:19.136
Their lives are easy, right?

23:19.656 --> 23:21.736
But for Auntie Feng and Uncle Chang,

23:22.176 --> 23:24.336
they are on the way to cross the river,

23:24.336 --> 23:25.336
it's peaceful,

23:25.896 --> 23:28.096
but they got a rising tide suddenly, right?

23:28.096 --> 23:29.816
They were swept away by the flood

23:30.296 --> 23:32.975
like ups and downs in their lives.

23:32.976 --> 23:34.256
They almost got drawn,

23:34.736 --> 23:36.456
but they didn't know where to go.

23:39.496 --> 23:40.976
As you said,

23:42.056 --> 23:43.136
it should be tougher.

23:44.176 --> 23:45.456
But it is tough now.

23:46.096 --> 23:47.296
Don't you think so?

23:48.136 --> 23:49.496
I feel

23:50.416 --> 23:51.536
it's not that tough.

23:53.776 --> 23:55.456
Not tough? Really?

23:56.816 --> 23:58.215
As you said,

23:58.216 --> 23:59.695
what they've been through was tough.

23:59.696 --> 24:00.696
But now,

24:01.336 --> 24:02.416
it becomes hard.

24:04.656 --> 24:07.136
We measured it differently.

24:08.456 --> 24:10.856
So what is your standard based on?

24:11.776 --> 24:13.616
You... Put everyone on an axis

24:13.616 --> 24:17.096
and compare the difficulty of their lives.

24:21.056 --> 24:22.056
Easy.

24:22.456 --> 24:23.456
Hard.

24:23.576 --> 24:24.576
And tough.

24:25.176 --> 24:27.936
There's a standard recognized by most people.

24:29.256 --> 24:30.856
Everyone is born at different levels.

24:31.656 --> 24:34.135
Someone is born at the next level

24:34.136 --> 24:35.536
where others can't reach.

24:36.696 --> 24:39.696
If they don't live with a silver spoon,

24:40.016 --> 24:41.296
it's torture for them.

24:42.136 --> 24:43.336
It's truly tough.

24:44.496 --> 24:48.536
People feel and think differently about pain.

24:49.216 --> 24:51.816
So how can you put them on the same axis?

24:57.816 --> 24:59.056
No matter which level you are,

25:00.856 --> 25:02.336
someone suffers more than you.

25:03.216 --> 25:04.736
And someone lives better than you.

25:06.016 --> 25:07.016
So as humans,

25:08.296 --> 25:12.096
you should put you on the axis to compare,

25:13.016 --> 25:14.016
with the old you,

25:14.616 --> 25:15.616
future you.

25:15.856 --> 25:19.056
There are many visions of you... to compare.

25:22.416 --> 25:24.896
You think Auntie Feng
have the good days now.

25:30.496 --> 25:32.616
She's gone through
the most challenging chapter of her life.

25:34.216 --> 25:38.336
So her life... will be better.

25:59.616 --> 26:00.616
Fruit desserts.

26:21.496 --> 26:23.255
Yao asked us to do

26:23.256 --> 26:25.216
the online agriculture live streaming.

26:25.216 --> 26:27.576
One night, 10
thousand kilos are sold.

26:28.296 --> 26:29.976
Huang introduced the program,

26:30.816 --> 26:32.136
and Yao contracted it.

26:32.576 --> 26:33.776
The pre-sale of our shop

26:34.016 --> 26:36.055
is one thousand kilos.

26:36.056 --> 26:39.456
The rest was driven
away by the truck Great.

26:39.856 --> 26:40.975
If it was in the past,

26:40.976 --> 26:42.575
it wouldn't have been sold at that price

26:42.576 --> 26:44.016
or it wouldn't be thrown away.

26:44.416 --> 26:45.335
It was.

26:45.336 --> 26:47.816
The past is the past.

26:48.056 --> 26:49.616
Everyone has hard days.

26:50.736 --> 26:52.456
My family was the same.

26:52.896 --> 26:56.056
Yang and Xi went to universities one by one.

26:57.016 --> 26:59.375
Life expenses and tuition fees

26:59.376 --> 27:02.176
drove me and Zeqing anxious.

27:02.456 --> 27:03.456
Mom.

27:03.856 --> 27:04.735
We've done eating.

27:04.736 --> 27:06.535
Could you clean the table?

27:06.536 --> 27:07.936
We're going to pick plums.

27:10.536 --> 27:11.936
I'll join you later.

27:48.856 --> 27:50.016
It's too heavy.

27:51.336 --> 27:52.375
Give it to me. I'm coming.

27:52.376 --> 27:52.776
I'll do it.

27:52.776 --> 27:53.175
Come on.

27:53.176 --> 27:53.376
I'm in.

27:53.376 --> 27:54.095
Together.

27:54.096 --> 27:55.096
Hold it together.

27:55.496 --> 27:56.496
Slow down.

28:00.776 --> 28:01.776
Take a break.

28:04.536 --> 28:05.536
Feng.

28:10.976 --> 28:12.655
What are you doing?

28:12.656 --> 28:13.855
It's for Chang.

28:13.856 --> 28:15.815
It's for the patient, not you.

28:15.816 --> 28:17.256
Don't take him as patient

28:17.256 --> 28:18.536
He's not seriously sick.

28:21.736 --> 28:23.256
He passed out of anemia.

28:23.256 --> 28:24.736
Isn't it serious?

28:26.096 --> 28:27.256
You're wired.

28:30.096 --> 28:31.496
I have too much to comment on.

28:32.376 --> 28:34.495
You raised chickens.

28:34.496 --> 28:35.855
You couldn't bear to eat them.

28:35.856 --> 28:37.256
So you sold them all.

28:38.536 --> 28:40.296
You could make money from the field,

28:40.736 --> 28:42.296
and from part-time jobs.

28:42.896 --> 28:45.536
You paid your debt a long time ago.

28:46.256 --> 28:47.576
I can't understand

28:47.936 --> 28:49.696
why two of you cut down so much

28:49.696 --> 28:52.136
on your living expenses?

28:52.816 --> 28:55.135
We save money to live better when we are old.

28:55.136 --> 28:56.456
We don't need money.

29:00.736 --> 29:03.535
As you just said, live
better when you're old.

29:03.536 --> 29:04.536
Here's the point.

29:04.856 --> 29:06.136
You have to live old enough

29:06.136 --> 29:07.776
so you can use the money you've saved.

29:08.336 --> 29:11.055
If both of you get sick before it,

29:11.056 --> 29:12.936
you have to spend more money.

29:13.296 --> 29:15.216
Don't feel sad about the loss of money?

29:16.096 --> 29:17.176
You are so clever.

29:17.176 --> 29:19.176
But you can't see the truth clearly.

29:31.056 --> 29:32.375
Why do you cry?

29:32.376 --> 29:34.176
I didn't say anything harsh.

29:34.656 --> 29:35.656
No.

29:36.016 --> 29:37.016
It's the wind.

29:41.496 --> 29:42.415
I see.

29:42.416 --> 29:43.816
It's because of the wind.

29:44.336 --> 29:47.096
Now you stand
where the wind comes.

29:47.656 --> 29:48.776
Come here. Come to me.

29:50.136 --> 29:52.136
I'll clean the wind for you.

29:54.416 --> 29:55.416
How are you?

29:55.496 --> 29:56.495
Rub the wind.

29:56.496 --> 29:57.496
Rub the wind.

29:59.016 --> 30:00.095
Have a break.

30:00.096 --> 30:01.256
Take a seat there.

30:01.576 --> 30:02.576
Come on.

30:07.776 --> 30:09.696
I haven't said thanks to you.

30:11.736 --> 30:13.176
You took me to the hospital,

30:13.496 --> 30:14.976
and came to help me today.

30:16.256 --> 30:18.456
In the past, I wasn't
friendly to you.

30:18.776 --> 30:19.776
I am sorry.

30:22.976 --> 30:24.336
Now you admit it.

30:25.856 --> 30:27.696
You were really bad to me.

30:30.816 --> 30:31.816
Feng.

30:33.096 --> 30:35.656
We've been like sisters for more than 30 years.

30:36.376 --> 30:37.896
Don't you know me?

30:38.696 --> 30:39.936
I can't think before I say it.

30:39.936 --> 30:41.376
I always talk nonsense.

30:41.616 --> 30:44.776
More than half of our villagers hate me for it.

30:46.136 --> 30:49.176
But you know, I have
no bad intentions.

30:50.416 --> 30:53.576
You kept saying
I like showing off.

30:58.296 --> 30:59.296
It's right.

30:59.496 --> 31:03.176
Sometimes, I do
like showing off.

31:04.856 --> 31:07.056
But I have a reason to show up.

31:07.496 --> 31:08.695
In our village,

31:08.696 --> 31:10.856
my family was penniless years earlier.

31:11.136 --> 31:11.975
We're not the poorest,

31:11.976 --> 31:13.736
but we are the second poorest.

31:14.016 --> 31:15.016
It's true.

31:15.256 --> 31:17.456
We could build a new house

31:17.456 --> 31:19.536
after Yang found a job after graduation.

31:20.176 --> 31:21.176
I know.

31:22.096 --> 31:23.615
No matter how I wanted to show off,

31:23.616 --> 31:25.695
but I've never shown it to you.

31:25.696 --> 31:26.696
It's true.

31:27.216 --> 31:28.336
You know me well.

31:29.536 --> 31:32.616
I had outworn underwear
inside my pants.

31:35.816 --> 31:38.935
You should tell
me what you think.

31:38.936 --> 31:41.176
How could I know it
if you didn't tell me?

31:41.656 --> 31:43.735
You're smart.

31:43.736 --> 31:45.176
But I have a one-track mind.

31:48.096 --> 31:49.936
Do you think I am good to you?

31:51.136 --> 31:53.576
If I harvest a pumpkin from my field,

31:53.576 --> 31:55.616
I'll definitely cut half for you.

31:56.256 --> 31:58.416
Whenever you harvested
scallions, potatoes,

31:58.416 --> 32:01.136
apples and plums,
didn't I come to help?

32:02.856 --> 32:04.936
I know you are nice to me.

32:05.376 --> 32:06.815
Don't say sweet words.

32:06.816 --> 32:08.656
I don't know if you're lying or not.

32:09.216 --> 32:12.376
You said we've been like sisters
for over 30 years.

32:12.816 --> 32:14.655
You know what kind of person I am.

32:14.656 --> 32:17.135
I prefer to say nothing
rather than lying.

32:17.136 --> 32:18.136
Right?

32:19.896 --> 32:21.056
You're right.

32:21.616 --> 32:23.656
Last time, you said I was jealous of you.

32:24.496 --> 32:25.455
I talked nonsense,

32:25.456 --> 32:26.816
because I was angry at that time.

32:27.056 --> 32:29.056
But I was jealous of you.

32:29.336 --> 32:30.255
Why?

32:30.256 --> 32:31.256
Why?

32:31.616 --> 32:34.216
Yang and Xi are outstanding.

32:35.736 --> 32:37.776
I didn't do anything wrong.

32:38.016 --> 32:40.136
But my life is full of pain.

32:42.536 --> 32:45.296
I lost my daughter when
she was a teenager.

32:45.776 --> 32:47.256
Now I only have one son.

32:48.216 --> 32:49.616
I am worried.

32:49.976 --> 32:50.936
Whatever he wants,

32:50.936 --> 32:52.415
I'll try my best to get it for him.

32:52.416 --> 32:53.416
Right?

32:56.976 --> 32:58.735
He finally found a job.

32:58.736 --> 33:00.936
A guard of warehouse was alright.

33:01.296 --> 33:02.576
But the payment needed to be more.

33:02.576 --> 33:03.816
I can send him money.

33:04.736 --> 33:07.056
But I've never expected
he would go to steal.

33:11.016 --> 33:12.816
I didn't teach him well,

33:15.256 --> 33:16.336
so he was in prison.

33:17.176 --> 33:18.615
It's for a long time.

33:18.616 --> 33:20.255
I thought he had learned his lesson.

33:20.256 --> 33:21.152
Right?

33:21.176 --> 33:22.336
He'd become a good man.

33:23.736 --> 33:25.776
But once a man made a mistake,

33:25.776 --> 33:27.856
everyone won't think better of him.

33:28.696 --> 33:30.776
No one in our village
will take care of him.

33:31.096 --> 33:33.455
But if anyone loses anything or gets stolen,

33:33.456 --> 33:35.055
they will think he does it.

33:35.056 --> 33:36.056
Am I right?

33:38.136 --> 33:40.616
Well... It's really possible.

33:41.536 --> 33:42.775
So my husband and I are thinking

33:42.776 --> 33:44.696
if we can make more money

33:45.016 --> 33:47.936
to make a down payment
of a house in the city.

33:48.416 --> 33:50.536
He will be a driver or run a grocery.

33:50.536 --> 33:51.376
Have a small business.

33:51.376 --> 33:53.176
He can't stay at home anymore, right?

33:54.896 --> 33:55.896
Feng.

33:56.936 --> 33:58.656
Your life is tough.

33:58.976 --> 33:59.736
For your whole life,

33:59.736 --> 34:02.016
you've been living for your children.

34:02.736 --> 34:04.615
Who is not living for the children?

34:04.616 --> 34:05.816
Don't you?

34:06.056 --> 34:07.575
When you were going to Qingdao,

34:07.576 --> 34:09.295
you packed so many bags

34:09.296 --> 34:11.616
that you can even open a shop.

34:11.936 --> 34:14.335
It's because Yan and Xi are in Qingdao.

34:14.336 --> 34:15.336
So I just...

34:22.056 --> 34:23.936
I didn't tell you, so
you don't know it.

34:24.456 --> 34:25.456
Yang

34:25.696 --> 34:27.136
is really terrible.

34:27.776 --> 34:29.375
Every time he invited us to Qingdao,

34:29.376 --> 34:31.735
saying come to eat seafood,

34:31.736 --> 34:33.575
but when we were about to go,

34:33.576 --> 34:35.776
something always happened to him.

34:36.216 --> 34:38.896
This time, we've
booked flight tickets.

34:39.336 --> 34:41.416
But he said his boss
asked him for a business trip.

34:42.416 --> 34:43.856
What's wrong with the business trip?

34:43.856 --> 34:46.016
It's common, isn't it?

34:46.656 --> 34:47.816
What do you know?

34:49.456 --> 34:50.416
Yang has to travel to work,

34:50.416 --> 34:52.136
but Xi doesn't have to.

34:53.096 --> 34:55.575
She's never invited us to go there first.

34:55.576 --> 34:57.376
She is also terrible.

34:58.576 --> 35:01.096
She thinks it's better
to go to Qingdao

35:01.096 --> 35:02.456
when her brother is there too.

35:06.256 --> 35:07.456
I've made up my mind.

35:08.136 --> 35:09.256
If they invite me next time,

35:09.256 --> 35:10.616
I'll never go to Qingdao.

35:11.016 --> 35:12.736
It's fine if they don't come home.

35:14.496 --> 35:16.855
They're always sending us money

35:16.856 --> 35:19.215
if it is a festival.

35:19.216 --> 35:21.975
But who cares about money?

35:21.976 --> 35:22.976
We would save the money

35:22.976 --> 35:24.936
and give back to them when they're back home.

35:25.776 --> 35:26.776
Yes.

35:29.216 --> 35:30.656
Don't drink this tea.

35:31.216 --> 35:32.216
Look.

35:32.896 --> 35:34.376
The tea leaves are not fresh.

35:34.776 --> 35:36.055
Dump it out.

35:36.056 --> 35:37.056
Try my tea.

35:38.136 --> 35:39.136
Look,

35:39.536 --> 35:41.536
Xi bought the tea for us.

35:41.816 --> 35:43.615
A high-grade tea. It's expensive.

35:43.616 --> 35:44.616
Enough. It's enough.

35:46.896 --> 35:49.496
Why did I talk about the bad girl again?

35:53.256 --> 35:53.895
The aroma.

35:53.896 --> 35:54.896
It's good, right?

36:09.416 --> 36:10.416
I'm fried now,

36:10.896 --> 36:12.096
what can you record?

36:18.616 --> 36:20.016
Are you tired now?

36:20.776 --> 36:21.776
No.

36:22.376 --> 36:24.176
Are you coming to pick tomorrow?

36:27.056 --> 36:28.096
Kill me.

36:28.656 --> 36:30.016
I won't come even if you kill me.

36:30.536 --> 36:31.775
Mr. Hu.

36:31.776 --> 36:33.816
He teaches us to sing.

36:33.816 --> 36:34.976
Mr. Hu.

36:36.496 --> 36:37.256
Nice to meet you, kids.

36:37.256 --> 36:39.136
Nice to meet you, Mr. Hu.

36:39.136 --> 36:40.216
Hi, guys.

36:40.696 --> 36:43.536
See you, Mr. Hu.

36:43.936 --> 36:44.455
See you, kids.

36:44.456 --> 36:45.535
Bye.

36:45.536 --> 36:47.015
- See you.
- See you. Mr. Hu.

36:47.016 --> 36:48.096
They are so lovely.

36:52.256 --> 36:53.935
Great. Mr. Hu.

36:53.936 --> 36:55.576
You are a real teacher now.

36:56.696 --> 36:57.935
A few days later,

36:57.936 --> 36:59.736
I'll ask for an official position there.

37:01.096 --> 37:03.016
A man like you can get it? In your dream.

37:04.656 --> 37:06.416
I can't join you tomorrow.

37:06.416 --> 37:09.095
I have to see a tea plantation in Fujian.

37:09.096 --> 37:10.456
Have you found a partner?

37:10.896 --> 37:11.855
From collage.

37:11.856 --> 37:13.456
A bro who once shared a room.

37:13.976 --> 37:14.976
But my budget is less.

37:15.616 --> 37:16.895
And you're so annoying.

37:16.896 --> 37:18.455
But he didn't abandon you,

37:18.456 --> 37:20.175
you should be nice to him.

37:20.176 --> 37:21.616
What is that supposed to mean?

37:22.216 --> 37:23.656
As it is widely said.

37:24.096 --> 37:25.456
A son never thinks his mother is ugly.

37:25.456 --> 37:27.455
A dog never detests its home,
however shabby it is.

37:27.456 --> 37:31.096
As it is widely said,
your words are pointless.

37:32.176 --> 37:32.856
A man like you

37:32.856 --> 37:34.496
will never get an official position.

37:35.336 --> 37:37.496
But I have my students.

38:06.736 --> 38:07.936
Morning. Damai.

38:09.696 --> 38:10.696
Mr. Ma.

38:10.936 --> 38:12.416
You're up so early.

38:12.936 --> 38:14.616
Aren't you leaving today?

38:15.376 --> 38:16.232
Yes.

38:16.256 --> 38:17.375
I got up early

38:17.376 --> 38:18.976
to sit in meditation and clear my mind.

38:21.816 --> 38:24.376
I saw your lights on in your room.

38:25.056 --> 38:26.056
You didn't sleep?

38:27.416 --> 38:29.855
I was exhausted when we're back yesterday.

38:29.856 --> 38:31.336
So I fell into sleep immediately,

38:32.136 --> 38:33.936
and woke up around three a.m.

38:33.936 --> 38:35.016
Then I kept writing.

38:36.616 --> 38:37.616
How is it now?

38:39.016 --> 38:41.216
The periodical fiction is about to end.

38:43.536 --> 38:45.336
Then you can take a break for a while.

38:46.976 --> 38:47.976
I can't.

38:48.376 --> 38:49.776
Is it urgent to go back for a job?

38:50.376 --> 38:51.856
It's not about the job.

38:53.976 --> 38:55.616
I've decided to start a new book.

38:59.416 --> 39:00.456
Really?

39:01.736 --> 39:02.776
Yes.

39:04.856 --> 39:07.576
I think, I like writing novels.

39:08.216 --> 39:11.095
Sometimes I feel it is painful.

39:11.096 --> 39:13.816
But the pain can inspire you.

39:14.576 --> 39:17.376
It's hard to write a good novel.

39:18.656 --> 39:19.935
But it seems that

39:19.936 --> 39:23.055
it is hard no matter what you want to do.

39:23.056 --> 39:24.896
If you find a job,

39:24.896 --> 39:26.775
you have to be worried about KPI.

39:26.776 --> 39:27.856
So I set myself free.

39:30.136 --> 39:31.136
Right.

39:32.136 --> 39:34.776
Never choose the easy path.

39:35.736 --> 39:37.936
Choose the path you want to go.

39:39.496 --> 39:41.576
So I learned it for you, Mr. Ma.

39:42.736 --> 39:43.736
I know,

39:44.216 --> 39:45.455
you had successful start-ups,

39:45.456 --> 39:46.855
but you also had failures.

39:46.856 --> 39:48.296
You made a lot of money.

39:48.296 --> 39:49.656
Now you have to start from zero.

39:50.096 --> 39:51.695
But you haven't given it up.

39:51.696 --> 39:52.576
You have the courage

39:52.576 --> 39:54.216
to start your journey again.

39:55.136 --> 39:56.496
I...

39:57.096 --> 39:59.216
am disturbed easily by the world.

39:59.736 --> 40:01.176
And I am utilitarian.

40:01.456 --> 40:03.376
I'm worried every day

40:03.376 --> 40:05.176
about what will happen in the future.

40:05.896 --> 40:06.975
People like you

40:06.976 --> 40:09.936
are fighting different challenges.

40:11.056 --> 40:12.896
I have been worn out already

40:12.896 --> 40:14.976
though I am only fighting with myself.

40:16.136 --> 40:17.936
I am not supposed to be like this.

40:19.776 --> 40:21.456
It's not about how you look now.

40:22.776 --> 40:24.416
You know, on the battlefield

40:25.616 --> 40:27.376
warriors are worn out, too.

40:27.816 --> 40:28.816
Right?

40:29.296 --> 40:30.336
It's not important.

40:31.456 --> 40:32.616
What matters is

40:33.496 --> 40:35.656
if you can stand up again in the end.

40:36.696 --> 40:37.896
Only if you stand up to fight back,

40:37.896 --> 40:39.016
you're a real warrior.

40:41.256 --> 40:42.336
So I think,

40:45.056 --> 40:46.856
we should learn from each other.

40:52.696 --> 40:55.256
Though the wind is roaring,

40:56.816 --> 40:58.296
the sun will always come out.

40:58.896 --> 41:00.336
All we have in the future

41:00.976 --> 41:02.616
is a good day.

41:45.136 --> 41:46.215
Good morning.

41:46.216 --> 41:47.216
Morning.

41:49.096 --> 41:49.976
Is it Mr. Hu?

41:49.976 --> 41:51.056
Are you going to pick?

41:51.736 --> 41:52.935
I have nothing else to do.

41:52.936 --> 41:54.096
I can have a free lunch.

41:54.976 --> 41:56.255
Let's go.

41:56.256 --> 41:59.056
Nana bought us some meat buns.

42:01.216 --> 42:01.855
What's wrong?

42:01.856 --> 42:02.856
Oh, my arms.

42:03.456 --> 42:04.456
Girls.

42:04.976 --> 42:05.976
Girls are weak.

42:09.536 --> 42:11.216
Mr. Hu is putting on a funny show.

42:11.976 --> 42:12.335
Let's go.

42:12.336 --> 42:13.895
I'm asking Yao if he joins us.

42:13.896 --> 42:14.896
No need to ask him.

42:15.056 --> 42:16.896
He's heading for Old Town with Huang.

42:17.296 --> 42:19.056
The owner of that unfinished guesthouse

42:19.056 --> 42:21.056
is afraid to get into town
though he's back now.

42:21.376 --> 42:22.376
I know it.

42:22.416 --> 42:23.896
The guesthouse is broken.

42:23.896 --> 42:24.832
It is.

42:24.856 --> 42:26.055
But what to do with it?

42:26.056 --> 42:27.216
Find someone to take it.

42:29.136 --> 42:30.375
Hurry up.

42:30.376 --> 42:32.496
Or we'll arrive late at noon.

42:35.942 --> 42:41.456
♫ Listen to the rain
falling into the silent forest ♫

42:43.416 --> 42:48.376
♫ Enjoy the mountainous landscape at sunset ♫

42:50.816 --> 42:56.896
♫ The raindrops on the roof
fall into the eyes secretly ♫

42:57.216 --> 43:02.576
